{"4498790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hazard Suits", "steam_appid": 4498790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/2ab18aaa26cf012f385dd575c7601310.avif?t=1785954046\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras_big/2ab18aaa26cf012f385dd575c7601310.webp?t=1785954046 width=1560 height=152 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome Volunteer, to the <strong>HAZARD SUITS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its time to suit up, stop the rain, and save earth from the Zombot hordes. Search abandoned locations for sweet cosmetics and gear upgrades in an endless wave survival that keeps you moving, adapting, surviving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/03ded92035676bee57d3b91c6765af55.poster.avif?t=1785954046\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/03ded92035676bee57d3b91c6765af55.webm?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/03ded92035676bee57d3b91c6765af55.mp4?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/b5552f22f1dbab8118a43331e95785b7.avif?t=1785954046\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras_big/b5552f22f1dbab8118a43331e95785b7.webp?t=1785954046 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sulphur Pumps spew toxic gases into the sky, a mad corporation with a quick fix gone horribly wrong.  Solve the code, destroy the Pumps, and get out with your head still attached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/d8757b75572dc3b1d3df6a337a304106.poster.avif?t=1785954046\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/d8757b75572dc3b1d3df6a337a304106.webm?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/d8757b75572dc3b1d3df6a337a304106.mp4?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/555aeac4877168e8cfd6e4c0a8c43ddd.avif?t=1785954046\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras_big/555aeac4877168e8cfd6e4c0a8c43ddd.webp?t=1785954046 width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of playing the same map? Not here! Each job is <strong>procedurally-generated</strong>, so that no two are alike. With multiple objective types and 3 key locations, each with their own unique challenges, your ability to adapt and explore might just save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/16f58643d59014319ce0ebcd5ee10be3.poster.avif?t=1785954046\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/16f58643d59014319ce0ebcd5ee10be3.webm?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/16f58643d59014319ce0ebcd5ee10be3.mp4?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/9e086cad21d6f005f7c841d2c8069179.avif?t=1785954046\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras_big/9e086cad21d6f005f7c841d2c8069179.webp?t=1785954046 width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print new guns and gadgets, and equip perks, to make each loadout your own. With gameplay based unlocks, you progress both your suit and your weapons individually. With thousands of ways to customise your suit and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/dd8ac081f9182da160961a7844d6dc0e.poster.avif?t=1785954046\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/dd8ac081f9182da160961a7844d6dc0e.webm?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/dd8ac081f9182da160961a7844d6dc0e.mp4?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/95c858f597bf6b7183b84c4dba5fdbc9.avif?t=1785954046\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras_big/95c858f597bf6b7183b84c4dba5fdbc9.webp?t=1785954046 width=1560 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for however you like to shoot your targets. Play solo, with 1-4 players online, or <strong>2 PLAYER SPLIT-SCREEN</strong>, and survive wave after wave of Zombot hordes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends taking all the loot? Fancy some solo levelling? Then play alone and enjoy the same core experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/fb7ef903d30d73733737b6320fdd4821.poster.avif?t=1785954046\" width=1170 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/fb7ef903d30d73733737b6320fdd4821.webm?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/fb7ef903d30d73733737b6320fdd4821.mp4?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUTTING YOU FIRST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No passes, no gated content, no pressure to play. The game is there, ready when you are!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/56744f9c9e2b53d38d72b526a18412c1.webp?t=1785954046\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras_big/56744f9c9e2b53d38d72b526a18412c1.webp?t=1785954046 width=1560 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE FROM THE DEV</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAZARD SUITS</strong> started as a passion project from a solo developer, with a goal to create an new classic FPS that puts player experience first. Growing up playing split-screen on the living room floor, this is a love letter to local multiplayer shooters.  Feedback is always listened to, so please reach out and let us know what you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/2ab18aaa26cf012f385dd575c7601310.avif?t=1785954046\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras_big/2ab18aaa26cf012f385dd575c7601310.webp?t=1785954046 width=1560 height=152 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome Volunteer, to the <strong>HAZARD SUITS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its time to suit up, stop the rain, and save earth from the Zombot hordes. Search abandoned locations for sweet cosmetics and gear upgrades in an endless wave survival that keeps you moving, adapting, surviving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/03ded92035676bee57d3b91c6765af55.poster.avif?t=1785954046\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/03ded92035676bee57d3b91c6765af55.webm?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/03ded92035676bee57d3b91c6765af55.mp4?t=1785954046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498790/extras/b5552f22f1dbab8118a43331e95785b7.avif?t=1785954046\" data-bi